{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026q1wwqATEO41793179050.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《愛·回家之三代同糖》一眾演員日前快閃將軍澳街頭與觀眾親密互動，為劇集宣傳並推介最新劇情發展。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"7e535831-f6de-420b-89cb-adb88f98e87b.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026hfJHOIYDWA1793179050.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3b8b5466-a896-4ec6-a374-d04b7c16e52e.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qW0vjtIeBr1793179049.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>臨近萬聖節，眾演員特別悉心打扮現身，以不同造型及角色變裝上演「搞笑小劇場」，成功吸引大批沿途路人與粉絲圍觀支持，現場場面非常熱鬧。此外，樊亦敏及歐瑞偉於昨晚一集正式登場，二人親自分享「回家」感受，眾演員亦即場預告未來的精彩場面，讓粉絲大呼期待！</p><p></p><p>出席：車婉婉、樊亦敏、歐瑞偉、李偉健、李茵彤、何依婷、侯雋熙、趙浚承、徐榮、容天佑、關曜儁、無綫集團有限公司製作部高級經理(戲劇)暨《愛．回家之三代同糖》監製羅永賢執行監製暨編審馬俊縈、執行監製謝浩洋、潘逸豪</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:52.013794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.573311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:24.859011+00:00","content_hash":"5418c2e1c5e5f36bdb0afd428b141d45873d6e80b56df49113f69dac0dd9c5d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:52.013794+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}